{
  "components": [
    {
      "text": "## Step 2 - edit rows\n\n**backend_value** is disabled here (backend-owned) and declares a default. Things to try:\n\n1. **Delete a middle row** - the following row must keep its own hidden_note, not its neighbour's.\n2. **Add a row** - its disabled backend_value is filled with the declared default and is really stored (visible in step 3).\n3. **Copy a row** (copy icon) - the copy is a new row and gets its own identity.\n4. **Reorder rows** - every row keeps its values.\n5. **Set number_a to 9** - hidden_note disappears but stays stored on its own row.",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_intro",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_intro"
    },
    {
      "label": "Text field (outside the list)",
      "type": "textfield",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_header",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_header_text",
      "key": "header_text",
      "disabled": true
    },
    {
      "label": "Dynamic list (my_list)",
      "components": [
        {
          "label": "text_a Label",
          "type": "textfield",
          "layout": {
            "row": "Row_item_1",
            "columns": 8
          },
          "id": "Field_text_a",
          "key": "text_a",
          "validate": {
            "required": true
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "number_a Label",
          "type": "number",
          "layout": {
            "row": "Row_item_1",
            "columns": 8
          },
          "id": "Field_number_a",
          "key": "number_a"
        },
        {
          "label": "backend_value Label (disabled, default = Value 1)",
          "values": [
            {
              "label": "Value 1",
              "value": "value_1"
            },
            {
              "label": "Value 2",
              "value": "value_2"
            },
            {
              "label": "Value 3",
              "value": "value_3"
            }
          ],
          "type": "radio",
          "layout": {
            "row": "Row_item_2",
            "columns": null
          },
          "id": "Field_backend_value",
          "key": "backend_value",
          "defaultValue": "value_1",
          "disabled": true
        },
        {
          "label": "hidden_note Label (hidden while number_a is 9)",
          "type": "textfield",
          "layout": {
            "row": "Row_item_3",
            "columns": null
          },
          "id": "Field_hidden_note",
          "key": "hidden_note",
          "conditional": {
            "hide": "=this.number_a=9"
          }
        }
      ],
      "showOutline": true,
      "isRepeating": true,
      "allowAddRemove": true,
      "defaultRepetitions": 0,
      "type": "dynamiclist",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_my_list",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_my_list",
      "path": "my_list"
    }
